{
  "name": "macro-memory",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": false,
  "description": "一套记忆，所有 agent：以 meow-memory 的库为主库、dsh-memory-nebula 的星图为索引，合成 8 个 memory_* 统一工具 + 一段最小注入。可作 MCP 服务器、CLI、core 库或本地管理界面用；装 DSH 是体验最好的路，但不是唯一的路。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/hanhan9999999999999999999/dsh-macro-memory.git",
    "directory": "."
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/hanhan9999999999999999999/dsh-macro-memory#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/hanhan9999999999999999999/dsh-macro-memory/issues"
  },
  "main": "./lib/core/index.js",
  "bin": {
    "macro-memory": "./bin/macro-memory.mjs"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/core/index.js",
    "./core": "./lib/core/index.js",
    "./mcp": "./lib/mcp/stdio.js",
    "./cli": "./bin/macro-memory.mjs",
    "./ui": "./lib/ui/server.js",
    "./dsh": "./lib/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "bin",
    "lib",
    "vendor",
    "docs/images",
    "docs/MAC.md",
    "docs/CHANGELOG.md",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24.0.0"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "memory",
    "agent-memory",
    "mcp",
    "model-context-protocol",
    "codex",
    "claude-code",
    "cursor",
    "macro",
    "meow-memory",
    "memory-nebula",
    "unified-tools",
    "universal",
    "deepseek-harness"
  ],
  "_comment": "这份文件是**模板**：version 由 tools/build-dual.mjs 从根 package.json 灌进来，保证两包永远同一个版本号。别在这里手填版本——手填就会漂。",
  "_versionNote": "PLAN §11.3 写的是 engines >=22；这里是 >=24。原因：核心存储用 node:sqlite，22 里还得带 --experimental-sqlite 才能用，等于「装上了跑不起来」。宁可门槛写在明处，也不给一句「怎么一启动就报错」。"
}
